@startuml
title Door
[*] --> Closed
state Closed : bolt in
state "Open wide" as Open #LightGreen
Closed --> Open : open
Open --> Closed : close
Closed --> Locked : lock
state Locked {
  [*] --> Armed
  Armed --> Alarm : force
  Alarm --> [*]
}
Locked --> Closed : unlock
state check <<choice>>
Open --> check : wind
check --> Closed : strong
check --> Open : calm
note right of Locked : keyed from outside
@enduml
